#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "An earlier draft said this was done before it was — Studio asked it to actually do it."
msgstr "前一稿说这件事已经完成，但其实还没有——Studio 已请它真正去做。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Choose an AI provider first (Provider)."
msgstr "请先选择 AI 服务商 (Provider)。"

# legal
#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "There is no {provider} API key yet: give one (APIKey), or say where it is kept (APIKeySource)."
msgstr "还没有 {provider} 的 API 密钥：请提供一个 (APIKey)，或指明它保存在哪里 (APIKeySource)。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Continuing (part {n})"
msgstr "继续回答（第 {n} 部分）"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Fixing the errors"
msgstr "正在修复错误"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Fixing 1 problem"
msgstr "正在修复 1 个问题"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Fixing {n} problems"
msgstr "正在修复 {n} 个问题"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Thinking"
msgstr "思考中"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Writing the answer"
msgstr "正在写回答"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Using {name}"
msgstr "正在使用 {name}"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Still answering: wait for it, or Stop."
msgstr "仍在回答：请等待，或点击“停止”。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "There is no question {n} in this chat."
msgstr "这段对话中没有第 {n} 个问题。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "That question is from before the chat was compacted: it can't be edited. Ask it again as a new question."
msgstr "这个问题来自对话被压缩之前：无法编辑。请把它作为新问题重新提问。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Nothing to compact yet: the chat is still short."
msgstr "还没有可压缩的内容：对话还很短。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Choose a model first (RefreshModels lists the provider's)."
msgstr "请先选择模型（RefreshModels 会列出服务商的模型）。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "You"
msgstr "你"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "编辑"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Assistant"
msgstr "助手"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Retry"
msgstr "重试"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Asking the server about the model"
msgstr "正在向服务器询问模型信息"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Compacting the conversation"
msgstr "正在压缩对话"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Summarising the chat to keep it short"
msgstr "正在总结对话以保持简短"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Answering…"
msgstr "正在回答…"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "This model takes {window} tokens at once (its context window, as the server runs it now), fewer than the instructions and tools alone need (about {need}). Choose a model or a server setting with a larger window: 16,384 tokens or more."
msgstr "这个模型一次最多处理 {window} 个 token（即服务器当前运行它时的上下文窗口），比仅指令和工具所需的数量（约 {need}）还少。请选择窗口更大的模型或服务器设置：16,384 个 token 或更多。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Type a question or a request first."
msgstr "请先输入一个问题或请求。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Still answering: wait for it, or Cancel."
msgstr "仍在回答：请等待，或点击“取消”。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Asking {provider} for its models…"
msgstr "正在向 {provider} 获取模型…"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Stopped."
msgstr "已停止。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Error: {message}"
msgstr "错误：{message}"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "This model takes no effort setting: it answers as it usually does."
msgstr "这个模型不支持强度设置：它会按平时的方式回答。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "This model can't think at an effort while it uses tools here: it answers without one."
msgstr "这个模型在这里使用工具时无法按强度来思考：它会不带强度地回答。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "{provider} lists {n} models."
msgstr "{provider} 列出了 {n} 个模型。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "{provider} answered, but not with a models list: {error}."
msgstr "{provider} 有响应，但返回的不是模型列表：{error}。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "The chat was compacted: what each question sends of it went from about {before} tokens to about {after}."
msgstr "对话已压缩：每个问题带上的对话内容，从约 {before} 个 token 减少到约 {after} 个。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "The conversation so far was summarised, to keep each question cheap."
msgstr "到目前为止的对话已被总结，以降低每个问题的费用。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Done."
msgstr "完成。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "The chat wasn't compacted: the model gave no summary."
msgstr "对话没有被压缩：模型没有给出总结。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "{provider} stopped answering: {error}"
msgstr "{provider} 停止了回答：{error}"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Asked the model to make the change it described"
msgstr "已请模型做出它所描述的更改"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Continue in smaller steps"
msgstr "分成更小的步骤继续"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "RAI stopped here: the answer kept reaching its length limit ({tokens} tokens), {parts} parts in a row. What it finished is above."
msgstr "RAI 在这里停下了：回答一再达到长度上限（{tokens} 个 token），连续 {parts} 部分。已完成的内容在上方。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "The model declined to answer this."
msgstr "模型拒绝回答这个问题。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Answer was long: continuing (part {part} of up to {parts})"
msgstr "回答较长：继续（第 {part} 部分，最多 {parts} 部分）"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Continued after the length limit ({n} of {max})"
msgstr "达到长度上限后继续（{n}/{max}）"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Continuing (part {n})…"
msgstr "继续回答（第 {n} 部分）…"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "The assistant didn't make the change you asked for. Ask again, or try a larger model."
msgstr "助手没有做出你要求的更改。请再问一次，或试试更大的模型。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Answered."
msgstr "已回答。"

#: crates/rapidr-ai/src/rai.rs
msgid "Summarising the conversation, to keep it cheap…"
msgstr "正在总结对话以降低费用…"

